Maine ek Java project banaya hai jisme maine Hibernate ki related dependencies add ki hain.

### 🔹 Hibernate Configuration File

Maine ek Hibernate configuration file banayi hai. Ye file important hoti hai kyunki iske through hum Hibernate ko batate hain:

* Hamara database **kahan located hai**
* Database se **connect kaise karna hai**
* Hibernate ki kuch settings kya hongi
* Data ko database me **kaise update** karna hai

Hibernate automatically SQL queries generate karta hai aur output me show karta hai.

### 🔹 DDL (Data Definition Language)

DDL ek language hoti hai jo database ka structure define karti hai, jaise:

* Table create karna
* Columns define karna
* Constraints set karna

### 🔹 hibernate.hbm2ddl.auto = update

Agar entity/class me koi structural change hota hai, toh wo database me bhi update hona chahiye.

Iske liye hum ye property use karte hain:

```xml
<property name="hibernate.hbm2ddl.auto">update</property>
```

### 🔹 show_sql & format_sql

* `show_sql` ka matlab hai Hibernate jo SQL query run kar raha hai, wo console me print hogi
* `format_sql` ka matlab hai query properly formatted form me print hogi (readable)

### 🔹 current_session_context_class = thread

```xml
<property name="hibernate.current_session_context_class">thread</property>
```

Iska matlab hai Hibernate automatically session create karta hai aur us session ko application ke current thread ke saath bind kar deta hai.

---

## ✅ Hibernate Working (SessionFactory & Session)

Hibernate me:

* Hum SessionFactory define karte hain
* SessionFactory ke through entity classes register karte hain
* Configuration create karte hain
* `buildSessionFactory()` use karke SessionFactory ka object ready karte hain

Phir SessionFactory ke object se hum Session lete hain.

---

## ✅ Entity Class Flow

Main class me:

* Sabse pehle ek class banayi
* Usko `@Entity` mark kiya
* `@Id` mark kiya (primary key ke liye, jo mandatory hota hai)
* Getters aur Setters banaye
* Constructor define kiya

---

## ✅ Run Hone Par

`UserClassHibernate` entity hone ki wajah se:

* Jaise hi application start hoti hai Hibernate automatically query generate karta hai
* Run karne par pehle table create karta hai

Main method me:

* Maine session open kiya
* User object ko `persist()` kiya

Toh Hibernate automatically insert query run karta hai aur data database me insert ho jata hai.

