## ✅ Hibernate Working (SessionFactory & Session)

In Hibernate:

* We define a SessionFactory
* Using SessionFactory, we register entity classes
* We create configuration
* We build the SessionFactory object using `buildSessionFactory()`

Then, from the SessionFactory object, we get a Session.

